<p>Intro with <em>emphasis</em>, <strong>strong</strong>, <del>struck</del>, <code>let x = &quot;a\\b&quot;;</code>, and a
bare URL <a href="https://example.com/path">https://example.com/path</a> plus <a href="https://www.example.org">www.example.org</a> and mail to
<a href="mailto:jaw@ekko.io">jaw@ekko.io</a> too. Literal math $x^2$ stays text. Unicode: Über Größe
日本語.</p>

<p>A resolved note link to <a class="note-link" href="linked.html">Current Linked Title</a>
and a dangling one to <strong>bold</strong> ghost.</p>

<p>An <a href="https://example.org/docs">external link</a>, a <a href="notes/other.md">relative file</a>,
an <a href="#table">anchor</a>, and a <a href="mailto:jaw@ekko.io">mail link</a>.</p>

